src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/be7313997ced2c904c60930845ce7113.mp4?t=1759965340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fold &amp; Fly </strong>features a <strong>map generator with seed input</strong> so you can create and <strong>save your favorite worlds</strong>, plus <strong>dynamic weather</strong> systems including <strong>volumetric clouds</strong>, <strong>thunderstorms</strong>, <strong>snow, fog and more</strong> to add atmosphere and challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong>Fold &amp; Fly</strong> is crafted by a small indie team from Montgreal, built with care, color, and a shared love for flying games. It’s a focused, replayable experience designed to bring a bit of wonder into your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/f8232008e187103f47db8b32d6cd2251.poster.avif?t=1759965340\" width=582 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/f8232008e187103f47db8b32d6cd2251.webm?t=1759965340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/f8232008e187103f47db8b32d6cd2251.mp4?t=1759965340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re offering this for the price of a  coffee, and if you choose to support us, big thank you! If you have feedback, ideas, or just want to tell us how far you flew, we’d love to hear from you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812280/extras/9d1a6bd46eb30dcbaef37e1338a516a7.poster.avif?t=1759965340\" width=350 h